# The Alaris simulator's ?library=workplace preview reads this file from public/.
# public/ publishes verbatim to a public website, and the studio's publish stages
# the whole directory -- so a real institutional drug library left here would be
# committed and served to anyone. The demo library (demo-library.json) is
# fictional and tracked; the real one must never be either.
public/pharmacy/alaris/local-library.json
